  "notes": [
    "global_costmap plugins are exactly [\"static_layer\", \"inflation_layer\"]; no obstacle_layer and no /scan subscription in global_costmap; dynamic obstacles only enter local_costmap (voxel_layer + inflation_layer).",
    "dry_run defaults to true; with dry_run=true the stack never imports unitree_sdk2py and never calls ChannelFactoryInitialize/SetFsmId/SetBalanceMode/SetVelocity.",
    "Single CycloneDDS: ROS RMW and unitree_sdk2py share CYCLONEDDS_HOME=.deps/dds/install/cyclonedds, with its lib prepended to LD_LIBRARY_PATH; conda must be deactivated first; pip install cyclonedds happens only after sourcing .deps/environment.bash with --no-binary cyclonedds==0.10.2.",
    "Front-wall test criterion: G1 facing a flat wall at 1 m, /scan angle 0 must read the wall; if angle pi reads the wall, stop tuning, switch lidar quaternion to X-180 (1,0,0,0) and re-test. check_stack.sh samples up to 10 frames, median of finite rays within +/-2 bins per frame, then median across frames (median/min/max printed).",
    "SLAM tuning gate: only after clean wall/TF//odom checks may minimum_time_interval/minimum_travel_distance/minimum_travel_heading go 0.5->0.2 and map_update_interval 5.0->2.0; use_scan_matching/correlative/loop-closing params stay untouched.",
    "Real-machine motion still requires on-site safety confirmation (e-stop ready, area cleared, firmware issue #170 pre-checked); dry_run:=false is never exercised in CI.",
    "No ROS environment on the Windows host: only compileall/banned-word grep/test_config.py ran locally; all ROS-level evidence is GitHub Actions CI (run 39457298308, both amd64 and ARM64 success).",
    "review_manifest.json lists every packaged file except itself (self-referential hash)."
  ]
